 connection ID and maximum cost.</p>



P7 =E2=80=94 sms_receives(number)
<p>Claim:</p>

<code>Exact number N receives fresh inbound SMS through the production webh=
ook/store path.
</code>
<p>Evidence:</p>
<ul>
<li>QP nonce N2</li>
<li>independent sender sends token to target number</li>
<li>inbound provider event with provider message ID</li>
<li>durable store readback keyed to exact destination number</li>
</ul>
<p>TRUE when challenge token is observed for exact target number within tim=
eout.</p>
<p>Do not use the current in-memory <code>smsStore</code> as canonical evid=
ence. Move SMS observations to durable append-only storage first.</p>



P8 =E2=80=94 handle_available(platform, handle)
<p>Claim:</p>

<code>At observation time T, platform P&#39;s supported availability probe =
indicates handle H is not currently assigned/reserved according to frozen p=
robe semantics.
</code>
<p>This is NOT ownership.</p>
<p>Evidence may be API/public probe/platform-specific, but ProofSpec must d=
efine admissible source and confidence/freshness semantics.</p>
<p>TRUE =3D admissible fresh provider/platform-specific evidence says avail=
able.<br>
FALSE =3D admissible evidence says taken.<br>
UNKNOWN =3D wall/captcha/rate-limit/no signal/ambiguous HTTP body/probe err=
or.</p>
<p>Never let <code>available</code> satisfy <code>account_owned</code> or <=
code>handle_bound</code>.</p>



P9 =E2=80=94 account_owned(platform, account_id)
<p>Claim:</p>

<code>The controlled credential principal can authenticate as exact platfor=
m account ID.
</code>
<p>Preferred evidence:</p>
<ul>
<li>authenticated <code>me</code> / account endpoint</li>
<li>account ID from provider</li>
<li>principal/credential binding hash</li>
</ul>
