es immutable metadata and hashes.</p>



16. Tasks and missions become projections, not truth sources
<p>Current task completion can set <code>status=3D&quot;done&quot;</code> d=
irectly. Stop allowing this to unblock canonical dependencies.</p>
<p>A task may track execution workflow, but downstream readiness must be co=
mputed from settled QP claims.</p>
