<p><code>task.complete</code> may indicate the worker finished an attempt. =
It may not establish that the world-state objective was achieved.</p>
<p>Mission completion must be a query over required settled claims, not ove=
r task booleans.</p>



17. Target JSON is plan/config, never proof law
<p><code>targets/*.json</code> may describe:</p>
<ul>
<li>desired target</li>
