20. Security boundary
<p>The minimal trusted base should remain small:</p>

<code>TrustBase =3D canonical hashing
          + QP verifier/settler
          + signature verification
          + tiny probe/effect runtime
          + immutable program bundles
</code>
<p>LLMs, planners, Playwright flows, provider adapters, Apify, target JSON,=
 task orchestration and UI are outside the constitutional trust base.</p>
<p>Workers propose.<br>
Probes observe.<br>
Judges judge.<br>
QP commits.</p>
<p>No self-promotion.</p>



21. Tests that must exist before calling this QP
<p>Create adversarial tests, not only happy paths.</p>
<p>Required minimum suite:</p>

Truth semantics
<ul>
<li>missing evidence =3D&gt; UNKNOWN</li>
<li>malformed evidence =3D&gt; UNKNOWN unless explicitly falsifying</li>
<li>one FALSE required leaf dominates AND-DAG</li>
<li>one UNKNOWN required leaf blocks TRUE</li>
<li>all TRUE required leaves =3D&gt; TRUE</li>
<li>stale evidence rejected/UNKNOWN</li>
</ul>

Claim identity
<ul>
<li>evidence for mailbox B cannot prove mailbox A</li>
<li>evidence for handle H2 cannot prove H1</li>
<li>evidence from account A2 cannot prove ownership in A1</li>
</ul>

Provenance
<ul>
<li>tampered payload hash fails</li>
<li>wrong collector program hash fails</li>
<li>inadmissible evidence class fails</li>
<li>same-channel evidence rejected when independent readback required</li>
</ul>

Program roots
<ul>
<li>change one judge byte =3D&gt; different ContractRoot or verification fa=
il</li>
<li>change runtime/config/dependency hash =3D&gt; fail under old root</li>
</ul>

Authority
<ul>
<li>invalid signature =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>expired grant =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>wrong subject =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>wrong action =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>payload changed after signing =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>price over cap =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>reused one-shot nonce =3D&gt; denied</li>
<li>truth TRUE without grant =3D&gt; effect denied</li>
<li>valid grant without truth prerequisites =3D&gt; effect denied when prer=
equisites required</li>
</ul>

Effect settlement
<ul>
<li>provider POST success + readback failure =3D&gt; target claim UNKNOWN /=
 no success receipt</li>
<li>provider POST failure =3D&gt; no target success receipt</li>
<li>successful readback =3D&gt; settled receipt</li>
<li>duplicate request/idempotency does not double-spend</li>
<li>reserve succeeds then effect crashes =3D&gt; reconciliation state, not =
silent reuse</li>
</ul>

Replay
<ul>
<li>canonical receipt replay =3D&gt; PASS</li>
<li>mutate any evidence byte =3D&gt; FAIL</li>
<li>mutate gate result =3D&gt; FAIL</li>
<li>mutate state_after =3D&gt; FAIL</li>
<li>mutate authority reference =3D&gt; FAIL</li>
<li>wrong historical freshness evaluation =3D&gt; FAIL</li>
</ul>

Non-circularity
<ul>
<li>worker self-reported <code>success:true</code> cannot satisfy target cl=
aim without admissible probe evidence</li>
<li>target JSON cannot mint a new trusted gate merely by naming it</li>
<li>task <code>done</code> cannot settle world-state claim</li>
</ul>



