<p>QP/AgentCom examines which are TRUE/FALSE/UNKNOWN.</p>
<p>For UNKNOWN claims it selects proof routes. Some routes are pure probes.=
 Some require an effect. Effects require authority. After the effect, indep=
endent evidence settles the target claim.</p>
